        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 1,
        "exact_text": "I am a risk analyst at an investment firm, and I need to quantify the downside risk of a proposed portfolio for our risk committee. Please build a portfolio risk simulation model. Portfolio: Stock A with 40% weight, 12% return, and 25% vol; Stock B with 35% weight, 8% return, and 18% vol; Bond C with 25% weight, 4% return, and 6% vol. Correlations: A-B=0.6, A-C=-0.2, B-C=0.1. Initial investment: 10M.\n",
        "source_sha256": "54756b0a154a9125a9b5bd6a72d8ab424eb273d841cecd8ce3a1ae490cf027a0",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_a618ea459fffac0c0177",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/data_computation_task2/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 3,
        "line_end": 3,
        "exact_text": "Create portfolio_var.xlsx with a 'Simulation' sheet containing 10,000 simulated scenarios accounting for asset correlations, and a 'Risk Metrics' sheet showing expected return, volatility, 95% VaR, 99% VaR, and max drawdown.\n",
        "source_sha256": "54756b0a154a9125a9b5bd6a72d8ab424eb273d841cecd8ce3a1ae490cf027a0",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
